Third-party components
----------------------

The Rust core links the crates below. They are not modified, and they are
listed here so the attribution they ask for travels with any binary that
includes them.

    boa_engine   Unlicense OR MIT          JavaScript engine
    miniz_oxide  MIT OR Zlib OR Apache-2.0 DEFLATE/zlib
    serde        MIT OR Apache-2.0         serialization
    serde_json   MIT OR Apache-2.0         JSON
    regex-lite   MIT OR Apache-2.0         regular expressions
    jni          MIT OR Apache-2.0         JNI bindings (Android only)

The Android app additionally uses Jetpack Compose and the AndroidX libraries,
which are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Nothing from Minecraft, Minecraft Pocket Edition, or BlockLauncher Pro is
included in this repository or in the binaries it builds.
